-name=\"empty title\">\n                                            لا توجد إيصالات بانتظار المراجعة\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)] mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"empty description\">\n                                            ستظهر هنا الإيصالات الجديدة عند إرسالها.\n                                        </p>\n                                        <a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--white)] underline underline-offset-4 decoration-[var(--dim)] hover:decoration-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"open payments log link\" href=\"payments.php\">\n                                            فتح سجل الدفعات\n                                            <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-left-short\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-2-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                                            </i>\n                                        </a>\n                                    </td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"quick access section\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"section header\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold mb-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"section title\">\n                        الوصول السريع\n                    </h2>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"section subtitle\">\n                        إدارة الأقسام الأساسية\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 max-[760px]:grid-cols-1 border-y border-[var(--border)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"quick access cards container\">\n                    <a class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 px-4 border-l border-[var(--border)] max-[760px]:border-l-0 max-[760px]:border-b hover:bg-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"users card\" href=\"users.php\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"card content group\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-people text-[18px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"users icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"card text group\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"users title\">\n                                    المستخدمون\n                                </strong>\n                                <small class=\"block text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)] mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"users description\">\n                                    إدارة الحسابات والخطط\n                                </small>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-left text-[12px] text-[var(--dim)] group-hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 px-4 border-l border-[var(--border)] max-[760px]:border-l-0 max-[760px]:border-b hover:bg-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"plans card\" href=\"plans.php\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"card content group\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-gem text-[18px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"plans icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"card text group\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"plans title\">\n                                    الخطط\n                                </strong>\n                                <small class=\"block text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)] mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"plans description\">\n                                    الأسعار والاشتراكات\n                                </small>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-left text-[12px] text-[var(--dim)] group-hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 px-4 hover:bg-[var(--surface)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"servers card\" href=\"servers.php\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"card content group\">\n                            <i class=\"bi bi-hdd-network text-[18px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"servers icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"card text group\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"servers title\">\n                                    الخوادم\n                                </strong>\n                                <small class=\"block text-[11px] text-[var(--dim)] mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"servers description\">\n                                    مصادر البث وقوائم التشغيل\n                                </small>\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <i class=\"bi bi-arrow-left text-[12px] text-[var(--dim)] group-hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
